Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.78,0:00:11.41,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1548,630)\fad(2000,0)}The Guild Hall
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.89,0:00:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Guild Hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.71,0:00:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.69,0:00:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.95,0:00:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,but I didn't realize there was one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.90,0:00:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We try to avoid attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.23,0:00:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you don't know where to look,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.76,0:00:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,the Guild tends to stay hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your card.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.40,0:00:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is from Laojun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:25.65,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.55,0:00:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It should help with your recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.92,0:00:28.59,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.12,0:00:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I bring this back after I'm done?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.38,0:00:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.34,0:00:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It should have more than enough on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.61,0:00:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Laojun tell you anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.30,0:00:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.94,0:00:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This card is also a pass to every Guild Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.35,0:00:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We offer services to all spirits who visit us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.46,0:00:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,All of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.14,0:00:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You probably don't know how the Guild operates now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.36,0:00:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like me to explain?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.91,0:00:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.86,0:00:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, it's part of my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.20,0:00:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The Guild was founded by Laojun and two other deities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:00:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one in each large human city.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.45,0:01:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We offer services for spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides acting as an inn, like in old times,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.56,0:01:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,it also provides financial support for living in the human world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.92,0:01:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.20,0:01:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.15,0:01:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Just follow the Guild's rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.91,0:01:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What are the rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.81,0:01:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't slay your own kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.64,0:01:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't reveal yourself to humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.07,0:01:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're willing to work with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.14,0:01:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,you can reap even more benefits.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.58,0:01:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna fight today, or not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.89,0:01:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.94,0:02:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll keep my mouth shut!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.36,0:02:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our practice field.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.86,0:02:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the ones we just met.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.82,0:02:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,They are frequent visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.77,0:02:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't live in the city because of their appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.29,0:02:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.94,0:02:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.75,0:02:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how come they can't take a human form?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.16,0:02:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,All spirits have their true form.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.22,0:02:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not about cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.76,0:02:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,A human form is only good for blending in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.57,0:02:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Even those who can't transform can find an expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.60,0:02:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They simply think it's below them to look human.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.07,0:02:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.69,0:02:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the strongest out of you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.39,0:02:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say I'm the weakest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.21,0:02:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how come you're the hall manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can make money.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.58,0:02:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you make money?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.26,0:02:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I sell these trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.82,0:02:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The lush vegetation here is your work, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.67,0:02:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.44,0:02:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.71,0:02:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Trees born quickly from magic also die quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.20,0:02:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But the trees whose growth I stimulate
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.82,0:02:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,are able to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.56,0:02:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are trees that expensive?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.60,0:02:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,High-quality wood is extremely valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.08,0:02:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.62,0:03:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And moneymaking made you the boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.78,0:03:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.25,0:03:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go a floor up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.57,0:03:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one more floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.95,0:03:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand still.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.34,0:03:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the core of our hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.26,0:03:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You can see the location and data of every Guild Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.94,0:03:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite the spectacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.63,0:03:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better at places with more bandwidth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.51,0:03:37.31,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Space fluctuations...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.91,0:03:38.79,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,This isn't just a map, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.05,0:03:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.25,0:03:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Every dot on the map represents a Guild Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.60,0:03:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides being a marker,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.12,0:03:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,each dot actually connects us to a hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.77,0:03:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying these are all space points?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.25,0:03:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.59,0:03:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.29,0:03:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Qianzhen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.56,0:03:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Manager!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.61,0:03:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Showing them around?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.98,0:04:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The others are waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.24,0:04:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You should hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.12,0:04:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya later, little spirits!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Some folks are having a meet-up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.38,0:04:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't hate humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.27,0:04:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't tell who's human.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.11,0:04:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone can use this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.42,0:04:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.29,0:04:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't there troublemakers?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.72,0:04:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.57,0:04:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You can see us over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.25,0:04:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The color of the upper dot shows the type of the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.37,0:04:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ours is gold, as we do mainly commerce.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.49,0:04:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The dots below stand for the resident spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.84,0:04:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There are three of us here, including Tu Bei and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.67,0:04:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Human assistants also work in every hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.00,0:04:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How do others offer support if they can't earn money?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.16,0:04:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Resources are shared among halls.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.01,0:04:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Like capital, space, military force,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.54,0:04:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,magic weapons and tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.04,0:04:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The hall manager can use them at their discretion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.92,0:04:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If there are humans here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.46,0:04:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,why is it a rule that you can't reveal yourself to humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.94,0:04:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Many humans already know about our existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.51,0:04:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you, a confidant of Lord Xuanli.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.51,0:04:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But not every human can tolerate us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.59,0:05:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It was better back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.77,0:05:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but since humans have gotten stronger, we've run into trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.82,0:05:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,After a few incidents, we established the current rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.23,0:05:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the best way to get along for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.58,0:05:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really get it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.93,0:05:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you have to earn money in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.31,0:05:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you just create gold or money?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.71,0:05:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It would wreck the human economy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.03,0:05:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,In the long run, it's best to follow their rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.08,0:05:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That means I should open an ice warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.07,0:05:27.67,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna steal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.89,0:05:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not making money...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.84,0:05:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you could do express deliveries.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.26,0:05:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.93,0:05:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done with the introduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.61,0:05:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to go into more detail?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.46,0:05:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.82,0:05:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's grab some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.91,0:05:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't you stay for lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.65,0:05:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, my grandfather is waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.89,0:05:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Today we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.14,0:06:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.18,0:06:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.26,0:06:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.07,0:06:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel free to accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.39,0:06:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from Laojun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.92,0:06:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you promise him anime merch?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.54,0:06:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.18,0:06:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I take you to Shanxin's?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.61,0:06:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to an anime con tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.79,0:06:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to head back and help fix the shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.83,0:06:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you in a couple days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.44,0:06:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.38,0:06:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Shanxin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.74,0:06:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know I was here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.58,0:06:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was about to head over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.30,0:06:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.19,0:06:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,'Sup, Gen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.51,0:06:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.60,0:06:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I came for Xiaobai.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.31,0:06:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And Xiaohei, for Huang.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.79,0:06:52.67,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I'd rather go home...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.29,0:06:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.47,0:06:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Fu and his group left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.07,0:07:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They went to the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.34,0:07:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They know their limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.41,0:07:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They might be following Lord Xuanli.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.93,0:07:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,They know how to behave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.27,0:07:22.02,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.33,0:07:25.19,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Unless you want to be attacked on the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.38,0:07:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.96,0:07:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a sparring partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.84,0:07:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.44,0:07:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Conflict means an opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.25,0:07:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What if they see us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.68,0:07:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.76,0:08:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.92,0:08:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we say we're just passing by?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.81,0:08:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.08,0:08:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.89,0:08:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.00,0:08:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't buy this...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.92,0:08:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.56,0:08:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Not both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.12,0:09:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They're equally strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.87,0:09:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What are your thoughts, Polao?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.13,0:09:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,One is just brute force.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.64,0:09:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The other is weak and powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.35,0:09:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you talking about, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.04,0:09:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You and him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.83,0:09:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, dumb toad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.54,0:09:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.20,0:09:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Axian.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.68,0:09:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.37,0:09:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cut me down...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.05,0:09:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you in such a hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.02,0:09:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He cut the space switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.91,0:09:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,"Return home"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.14,0:09:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.70,0:09:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's no more business,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.11,0:09:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,may I leave now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.67,0:09:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We came for the Sky Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.43,0:09:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you willing to part with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.85,0:09:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.45,0:09:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.01,0:09:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Vow quest prizes are fair game to steal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.69,0:09:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose you knew about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.59,0:09:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.03,0:10:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You say the Sky Pearl you have is not from Laojun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.98,0:10:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any Sky Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.19,0:10:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.24,0:10:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.76,0:10:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He really doesn't have the Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.02,0:10:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So even you can be wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.45,0:10:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it must be with the girl or the cat after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.63,0:10:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I was careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.15,0:10:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So may I leave now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.46,0:10:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall keep us company for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.68,0:10:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You really have it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.87,0:10:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell when someone is lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.52,0:10:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point trying to deny it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.64,0:10:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to leave, you must defeat all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.17,0:10:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.64,0:10:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't trouble you any longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.60,0:10:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no trouble at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.53,0:10:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, we're going to trouble you for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.06,0:10:45.48,Title 2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1350,550)\fad(2000,0)}Mission: Sky Pearl
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.04,0:10:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.23,0:10:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Go forward and throw a grenade!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.58,0:10:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.96,0:11:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.43,0:11:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.05,0:11:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,See you out there.
