Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.10,0:11:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.21,0:11:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.84,0:11:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't this just come out yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.95,0:11:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.95,0:11:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a pro after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.24,0:11:36.01,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I'm so tired...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.12,0:11:51.92,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,What does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.99,0:11:53.65,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Can I eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.89,0:12:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This spirit space is quite comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.68,0:12:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.47,0:12:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.62,0:12:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,For your comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes no sense to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.71,0:12:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.97,0:12:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But last time you beat us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.43,0:12:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you guys are weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.87,0:12:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.52,0:12:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there a wall here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.35,0:12:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Axian!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.97,0:12:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The space ends here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.60,0:12:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.74,0:12:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It ends abruptly?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.73,0:12:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.12,0:12:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't spirit spaces spherical?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.99,0:12:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Only natural, complete spaces are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.85,0:12:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.71,0:12:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we're in the same boat now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.74,0:12:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,will you tell me why you came after us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.66,0:12:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,"River Fu" Spirit Elixir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.70,0:12:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The day after a stable state is reached,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.07,0:13:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,take one pill in the morning, noon, and night,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.63,0:13:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and you'll be cured.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.24,0:13:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,P.S.!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.23,0:13:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hello to Wuxian for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.16,0:13:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what it says.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.78,0:13:11.45,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.67,0:13:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you talking to Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.76,0:13:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.71,0:13:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep on dreaming, girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.77,0:13:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei can understand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.23,0:13:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And Huangshou understands me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.94,0:13:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huang!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.91,0:13:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you acting so weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.37,0:13:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Can he understand a lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.58,0:13:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Be happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.88,0:13:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.17,0:13:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Say meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.79,0:13:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Convinced yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.02,0:13:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.68,0:13:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.62,0:13:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Be happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.19,0:13:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Be scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.43,0:13:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Convinced yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.16,0:13:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.96,0:13:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only can he understand me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.42,0:13:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can understand him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.55,0:13:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How is this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.84,0:13:57.55,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.88,0:13:58.86,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,You can tell her we can talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.86,0:13:59.71,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,but don't mention spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.71,0:14:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.68,0:14:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What if it's true...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.15,0:14:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to test it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.62,0:14:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to an anime con tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai is the cutest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.50,0:14:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, don't flatter me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.08,0:14:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.02,0:14:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,One more test!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.38,0:14:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You took Xiaohei to the bathroom,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.92,0:14:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but just stared at him and didn't say a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.70,0:14:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.79,0:14:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.15,0:14:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei also understands Bidiu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.24,0:14:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He can translate for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.77,0:14:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huang, you're useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.71,0:14:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei says Huangshou says he's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.29,0:14:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You little glutton...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.50,0:14:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinner's ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.74,0:14:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I take it back, you're awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.17,0:14:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinner's ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.38,0:14:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.43,0:14:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Moss, Axian and Tanjiu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.13,0:14:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So you three came for the Sky Pearl too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.53,0:15:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you mad at us, Lord Xuanli?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.33,0:15:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.35,0:15:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This might be your lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.36,0:15:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You need it for cultivation?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.04,0:15:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.80,0:15:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit force is scarce today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.38,0:15:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cultivation got much harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.09,0:15:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry we left you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.01,0:15:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you found it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.22,0:15:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.74,0:15:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to trace those riding a vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.31,0:15:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You said earlier that if we can find it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.45,0:15:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd give it to us, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.26,0:15:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.13,0:15:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got no chance against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.41,0:15:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And I want them to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.95,0:15:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.11,0:15:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How can a robbery be that civilized?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.01,0:15:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They are all well-mannered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.05,0:15:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just now...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.03,0:15:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I heard you call him Xuanli.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.58,0:15:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.61,0:15:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.71,0:15:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But he is not Xuanli.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.15,0:15:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I never said I was him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.20,0:16:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.33,0:16:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So many people!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.89,0:16:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.92,0:16:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the biggest anime convention in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.57,0:16:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know Xiaohei was interested in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.96,0:16:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's rare for a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.13,0:16:53.33,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Better than staying there...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.97,0:17:29.40,Title 3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1350,725)}Anime Convention
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.96,0:18:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I've sensed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.45,0:18:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This one, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.40,0:18:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your purchase!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.75,0:18:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you buy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.97,0:18:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a small gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.30,0:18:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.32,0:18:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Handsome guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.04,0:19:00.94,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,"All Living Beings" is now available at Sector B3.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.22,0:19:03.51,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,An ID is required to make a purchase.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.51,0:19:05.00,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Do not use another person's ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.33,0:19:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go stand in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.64,0:19:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You go have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.92,0:19:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.96,0:19:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not even buying it...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.99,0:19:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet when I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.21,0:19:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.61,0:19:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Dad's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.54,0:19:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Mr. Shan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.79,0:19:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.86,0:19:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.90,0:19:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.52,0:19:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling better, kitten?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.73,0:19:22.45,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.45,0:19:23.65,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you come back last time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.17,0:19:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the past alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.81,0:19:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the topic?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.69,0:19:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,World politics.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.97,0:19:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.63,0:19:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Shopping for Master Lao.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.77,0:19:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to do that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.28,0:19:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What a coincidence that we ran into each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.81,0:19:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard your voice, so I came over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.16,0:19:41.01,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,You come here often?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.01,0:19:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.02,0:19:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I can be myself here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.38,0:19:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You like conventions?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.75,0:19:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, can we take some pictures with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.94,0:19:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.25,0:19:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.08,0:19:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.37,0:19:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What character is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.45,0:19:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea, but he's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.82,0:19:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oho...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.95,0:19:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Being yourself, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.87,0:19:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.41,0:20:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have to disguise myself here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.27,0:20:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was Tanjiu who created your copies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.65,0:20:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Only your spirit parts are here right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.45,0:20:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.42,0:20:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Our real bodies are in a safe place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.62,0:20:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't get hurt even if our copies are destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.62,0:20:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, if we don't get them back,\Nwe lose cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.07,0:20:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Judging by your appearance,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.35,0:20:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume you live among humans, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.60,0:20:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.66,0:20:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We even have jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.09,0:20:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.70,0:20:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We are...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.50,0:20:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Manhua artists!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.18,0:20:27.98,BG - Manga,,0,0,0,,{\p1}m 1515.5 903.2 b 1529.9 921.5 1544.2 939.8 1558.5 958.1 b 1566.5 980.4 1574.5 1002.7 1582.4 1025 b 1607.9 1037.8 1633.4 1050.5 1658.9 1063.3 b 1733 1063.3 1807 1063.3 1881.1 1063.3 b 1905 1050.5 1928.9 1037.8 1952.8 1025 b 1940 968.5 1927.3 912 1914.6 855.4 b 1888.3 869.7 1862 884.1 1835.7 898.4 b 1815 894.4 1794.3 890.4 1773.6 886.5 b 1768 875.3 1762.4 864.2 1756.9 853 b 1756.9 853 1659.3 874.6 1632 872.6 b 1604.6 870.6 1530.6 866.6 1530.6 866.6{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.18,0:20:27.98,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(1750,934)\fs40\3c&HA482BF&}They're late\Nwith manuscripts\Non cultivation days
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.83,0:20:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never met a spirit who has such a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.27,0:20:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So you are in fact not Lord Xuanli?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.23,0:20:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.15,0:20:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,May I ask your family name?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.78,0:20:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Luo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.65,0:20:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolverine?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.92,0:20:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.40,0:20:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Will we stay here forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.53,0:20:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.61,0:20:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose you'd rather leave too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.61,0:20:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So you have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.17,0:20:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If we join forces,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.49,0:20:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,we can't defeat them,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.85,0:20:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's easy to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.65,0:20:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,These ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.51,0:20:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You think he'd like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.58,0:21:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd like these two, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.30,0:21:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.19,0:21:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.56,0:21:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you take this to Laojun?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.94,0:21:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You bought it for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.58,0:21:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take it yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.22,0:21:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.35,0:21:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But Gen said the Blue Jade Disc can be used only once a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.08,0:21:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll take it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.76,0:21:18.77,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Didn't Laojun make it himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.12,0:21:20.52,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Why can't you use it more often?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.65,0:21:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The Disc is a first-rate magic tool for fixed-point teleportation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.92,0:21:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose the limit was set especially for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.20,0:21:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.27,0:21:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't want me to visit more often?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.36,0:21:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.63,0:21:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You should ask him next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.62,0:21:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.99,0:21:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Your badges are packed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.34,0:21:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.61,0:21:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.79,0:21:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite crowded...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.16,0:21:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be easy...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.20,0:21:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.88,0:21:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait until they come out?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.65,0:21:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you found it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.64,0:21:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.74,0:21:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time you kept your promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.91,0:22:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it strange you can't see the other three?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.26,0:22:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.48,0:22:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Your closed eyes must be a facade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.45,0:22:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I assumed you relied on spirit sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.46,0:22:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you noticed they already left?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.58,0:22:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,None of you can leave this spirit space.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.15,0:22:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so sure about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.51,0:22:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,None of you are space-type.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.15,0:22:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know we can't leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.62,0:22:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiuxian.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.39,0:22:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay here and keep watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.82,0:22:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll call Polao in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.66,0:22:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what are all these humans doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.67,0:22:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's market day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.80,0:22:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Polao.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.93,0:22:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come in for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.87,0:22:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.48,0:22:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They are not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.76,0:22:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.68,0:22:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't possess such abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.53,0:22:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, why would they have stayed for so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.23,0:23:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They are going to look for the Sky Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.43,0:23:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.00,0:23:32.38,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.00,0:23:32.38,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Stay with me - let's walk on, kicking pebbles as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.38,0:23:37.12,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.38,0:23:37.12,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Our destination may be whimsical
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.12,0:23:41.82,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.12,0:23:41.82,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But with the scent of flowers in both hands
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.82,0:23:48.02,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Kore kara deau kimi e to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.82,0:23:48.02,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,I’ll carry it to the you I’ve yet to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.02,0:23:54.17,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.02,0:23:54.17,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Wait for me — let’s talk, side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.17,0:23:58.97,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.17,0:23:58.97,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Even if our first "hello" is a little awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.97,0:24:03.65,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.97,0:24:03.65,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,When we open the boxes we’ve brought
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.65,0:24:10.17,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.65,0:24:10.17,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Let’s share the dreams we’ve packed inside
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.17,0:24:21.49,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.17,0:24:21.49,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,The days when we can casually say "See you tomorrow"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.49,0:24:26.91,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.49,0:24:26.91,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Are so precious and so fleeting
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.91,0:24:31.95,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.91,0:24:31.95,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Those feelings will never fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.95,0:24:43.18,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.95,0:24:43.18,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,We can’t catch up to the clouds drifting across the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.18,0:24:48.73,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete kitto boku wo yonderu
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.18,0:24:48.73,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But they’ll turn to rain, bloom into flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.73,0:24:55.57,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.73,0:24:55.57,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,And surely, they’re calling out to me
